Action Input: {"smiles": "CC1=C(C2=C(C=C1)C(=O)C=CC2=O)C"}

Thought: The SMILES string "CC1=C(C2=C(C=C1)C(=O)C=CC2=O)C" is also valid. I will continue validating the remaining SMILES strings.
